<title>GERMANY: Gerling 7-mth new life business up.</title>
<headline>Gerling 7-mth new life business up.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven months to July 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    New sums insured			   4,800   up   6.7 pct</p>
<p>    Payouts to customers			 981   down 4.4 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German insurer is Gerling Konzern Lebensversicherungs AG, the life insurance arm of Gerling. The company also said that its premium income including income from reserves was around the year-ago level at 1.6 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
